PTX tearing+vector.v4.u64
"A 32-byte relaxed vector store and load of four 64-bit elements: more than the 16 bytes of D43, so the elements are separate operations (6569) and the load may see some new values and some old ones: allowed."
{
a=0;
b=0;
c=0;
d=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
P1:r2=0;
P1:r3=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0                           | P1@cta 1,gpu 0                                   ;
 st.relaxed.gpu.v4.u64 a, b, c, d, 1, 1, 1, 1 | ld.relaxed.gpu.v4.u64 r0, r1, r2, r3, a, b, c, d ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r3 == 0)
